    "body": "Bingo. I've put an extra `enable_ansi_support()` to the end of main and now ANSI escape sequences work properly.\r\n\r\nIt seems somehow executing commands in this particular way leads to disabling [ENABLE_VIRTUAL_TERMINAL_PROCESSING](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/console/setconsolemode).",
