    "updated_at": "2021-02-02T14:23:10Z",
    "body": "Yes, it does work when calling `enable_ansi_support()` at the end of main only. (Which seems to make sense, since this way ENABLE_VIRTUAL_TERMINAL_PROCESSING is enabled after all commands have finished.)\r\n\r\nI suspect the root cause might be related to stdin being inherited by commands executed by starship -- and one of them maybe disabling ENABLE_VIRTUAL_TERMINAL_PROCESSING on the console?",
