    "updated_at": "2021-02-02T14:51:24Z",
    "body": "Ok, I've narrowed down the issue to calling `id -u` in the `modules::username::get_uid()`. This seems to be the `id.exe` installed with Git on my machine, and for some reason it seems to disable the ENABLE_VIRTUAL_TERMINAL_PROCESSING flag on the console it's running on. (Most probably this should not be run on Windows at all, since the only purpose of its result is comparing it with ROOT_UID (0), which is bogus on Windows.)\r\n\r\nJust removing this one command seems to make a difference.\r\n\r\nI'll test explicitly setting stdin to null right away.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
